config MTK_C2PS
	bool "MediaTek MT6989 camera per-task performance control"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && PROC_FS && UCLAMP_TASK
	depends on ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS
	help
	  Expose the rothko camera HAL ioctl at /proc/c2ps/c2ps_ioctl.
	  Apply and restore fixed per-thread utilization clamps for registered
	  tasks. The HAL needs its stock node permissions and CAP_SYS_NICE.
	  ACTIVATE and ADD_TASK select only this fixed policy. Gear limits,
	  VIP controls, task-group tuning and adaptive inputs are unavailable.
	  Scene changes, VSYNC/CAMFPS and single-shot requests are unsupported.
